down his water glass, and was also looking at her. A dry ray of sunlight streamed in through the newly hung curtains, shining on his face as he seemed ready to hear what she had to say.
“Will today be another busy day for you?” she asked. She was gripping the napkin on her lap as she gazed at him. In his beautifully handsome face, she thought she could see signs that he had changed a lot, but she wasn’t sure. Maybe things were the same as always.
