“That grand gesture showed how much he loves Layla,” Elise continued. ‘Such love doesn’t disappear overnight. And yet, today, he’s acting like-”
“Elise, look over there,” Katharina said, chuckling quietly to herself as she pointed to the table by which Matthias had been sitting.
At first, Elise thought she was pointing to the cup of tea, which had gone cold in Matthias’s hands without him taking a single sip. However, she soon

noticed something else, next to the cup. Her eyes went wide and she muttered, “Goodness…”
